@comment{Sources cited on the website's study pages (site/*/index.qmd). gilbert-*, bantock-iom3, selig1989,
  tmr-naca0012, klaka2022 and lyon1997 come from the project's own notes
  (docs/research/, projects/foil2d/). menter1994, langtry2009 and wagner1925
  were checked against Crossref, and jones1938 against NASA NTRS, on
  2026-10-17. Jones's TN 667 gives the Wagner-function approximation the page
  uses: (2 pi - 0.330 pi e^(-0.0455 s) - 0.670 pi e^(-0.300 s)), s in
  half-chords.}

